# Formadagi arizalar shu Telegram chatiga yuboriladi.
# Ikkalasi ham bo'lmasa, ariza faqat server logiga yoziladi.
#
# 1) @BotFather da bot yarating -> token
# 2) Botni kerakli guruh/kanalga qo'shing yoki unga shaxsan yozing
# 3) chat_id ni oling:
#    curl "https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates"
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
